            "title": "CORRECTED — Impact Biomedical Inc (NYSE: IBO) Announces 1 for 12.62 Reverse Stock Split to Pursue Completion of Merger with Zoar Limited (f/k/a Dr Ashleys Limited)",
            "id": "99752178-f1c5-4426-b75f-187f8284d235",
            "description": "A press release was issued to correct the merger exchange ratio in Impact Biomedical Inc.'s announcement from September 11, 2026. It was initially stated that Impact stockholders would receive 1 share of Zoar Limited for every 4 shares of Impact Common Stock. However, the accurate exchange ratio, as per the Merger and Share Exchange Agreement, is 1 share of Zoar Limited for every 1 share of Impact Common Stock held before the merger's effective time, after the Reverse Stock Split. This update stems from a Form 8-K report dated June 23, 2025. The correction retains all other details from the original release.",
